# Merge-policy for append-only ledgers.
# agents/bugs.md is the swarm bug ledger: every lane APPENDS its entry at EOF
# (verified: last 5 main touches are +N/-0 diffs). Two concurrent lanes therefore
# always "conflict" at the same tail hunk even though no content overlaps, and
# union merge keeps both appended rows — the semantically correct resolution.
# (Renumbering of BUG IDs at merge time stays a human/owner edit, as documented
# in the ledger entries themselves.)
agents/bugs.md merge=union
